How the methods were tested
───────────────────────────
  Assets      US Equity, Intl Equity, Bonds, Gold and Real Estate; T-Bills as
              cash. Monthly returns, Nov 1996 to Oct 2026.
  Validation  In sample: fitted to the whole history and scored on it.
  Limits      At most 40% in any asset; fully invested.
  Trading     Rebalanced quarterly, no trading costs.
  Ratios      Against the T-Bills return, 2.3% a year over the test; value at
              risk and expected shortfall from history, at 95% over one month.

